		{
			dependencies: ["178FC7958159A73B"]
			description: [
				"The pack also has several other misc. changes, tweaks, and thingies that are worth mentioning:"
				""
				"- Clerics buy Sculk Tendrils and sell Purity Shards and Purification Flasks"
				"- Wandering Traders sell Sniffer Eggs, Purity Shards and Purification Flasks"
				"- Sniffer eggs can be found in Jungle Temples."
				"- Reading a structure map gives you a waypoint to the structure."
				"- Skeletons turn into Wither Skeletons when dying to lava."
				"- Wither Skeletons and Magma Cubes spawn naturally deep underground."
				"- Sculk Mushrooms can brew Awkward Potions."
				"- Generators are removed, power for furnitures is obtainable by Transformers, that use FE to generate power."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- Quark normally makes it so netherite equipment is repairable with diamonds, this is also applied to necromium."
				"- Items repairable with Treated Iron now use Steel"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "thermal:lead_gear"
			id: "3FA037854B984F4F"
			optional: true
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{
				id: "1219F9E75C77FD39"
				title: "I understand"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Misc. Changes"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["178FC7958159A73B"]
			description: [
				"After &e10 days&r, the Sculk Horde will awaken and begin corrupting the world, starting at the world's center, and begin accumulating mass from feeding off other living things."
				""
				"The horde is not a threat you should ignore, and you should be constantly fighting it. "
				""
				"You must prepare yourself against this spreading corruption with weapons and equipment to kill and purify the Sculked masses."
				""
				"The following quests will guide you through all the steps needed to kill the Horde, but be warned: It won't be quick, or easy."
